@gateway = http://127.0.0.1:8090

### Gateway's own health (does not check Orderflow)
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/health

### Create via gateway; a fresh product makes the exercise repeatable
# @name createGatewayProduct
POST {{gateway}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Request-Id: client-value-will-be-replaced

{"name":"Gateway practice keyboard","price":1250.00,"stock":10}

> {% client.global.set("gatewayProductId", response.body.id); %}

### Read the product; observe X-Request-Id and gateway log
GET {{gateway}}/api/products/{{gatewayProductId}}

### Create an order ONCE (no idempotency protection is installed yet)
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":{{gatewayProductId}},"quantity":2}

> {% client.global.set("gatewayOrderId", response.body.id); %}

### Read the actual generated order
GET {{gateway}}/api/orders/{{gatewayOrderId}}

### Backend validation still owns invalid business input: expect 400
POST {{gateway}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":{{gatewayProductId}},"quantity":0}

### Not in the gateway route allowlist: expect 404
GET {{gateway}}/api/learning/status

### Management internals are not exposed: expect 404
GET {{gateway}}/actuator/env
